# Paths that move to the private companion repo (release plan C-c). Prefix (dir/) or exact path or fnmatch glob.
# text scan skips them; binary scan accepts files under them (but not shipping src embedding them).
# docs/: records of sessions, playthroughs, audits and units (who did what when), the refactor's move map and plans,
# benchmark logs, screenshots of the game, and the third-party map pack note (docs-table.md in the release audit).
